  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible incidents of controlled hardware being re‑exported through third countries prompt quicker regulatory and legislative responses in Europe (new controls, licensing changes, or export‑screening), accelerating policy adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">euro_security_autonomy</data>
