  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising probability of controlled hardware leaking via third markets increases the odds of abrupt sanctions, retaliatory measures and supply shocks, which elevates perceived tail risks and shifts investors toward safer assets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
</edge>
