  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Documented or publicized instances of controlled hardware being re‑exported to Iran prompt immediate targeted sanctions and expanded secondary‑sanctions designations on intermediary firms and transit states.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
