  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Documented or credibly suspected re‑exports of controlled hardware to restricted end users trigger targeted punitive measures and expansion of sanction lists against intermediaries and transit jurisdictions, increasing overall sanctions severity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
