  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A measurable uptick in advanced chip deliveries to Iranian actors accelerates their ISR and anti‑ship/missile integration, raising perceived maritime risk and causing shipowners and charterers to reroute or reposition tankers and request escorts.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
</edge>
