  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased cross‑border flows of advanced semiconductors enable faster fielding and capability upgrades for drones, EW, sensors and guided munitions, directly raising one side's effective combat power relative to the other.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
