  <data key="d36">Intense and frequent congressional hearings, subpoenas or proposed legislation raise regulatory and legal risk for AI firms and VCs, prompting investors and funds to pause or withdraw planned rounds and M&amp;A until uncertainty resolves.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
