  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising European industrial investment in domestic energy infrastructure, storage and alternative supplies reduces dependence on Iranian crude and makes policymakers more able and willing to sustain or escalate sanctions, raising sanction pressure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">euro_security_autonomy</data>
