  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in European advanced semiconductor manufacturing output raises the stock of exportable advanced chips, directly increasing the volume-per-time of cross‑border flows (including channels that can reach Chinese markets).</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">euro_security_autonomy</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
