  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher supply‑chain vulnerability drives procurement from intermediate/opaque suppliers and brokers, increasing the probability that controlled components are diverted into secondary markets and re‑exported to restricted end destinations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">euro_security_autonomy</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
